 r'''\oursComputed\ Summing the character series gives \(\sum_{n\ge1}n\lambda^{-n}/(\lambda-\lambda^{-1})=\lambda^2/[(\lambda-1)^3(\lambda+1)]\). Squaring and substituting \(t=\lambda+\lambda^{-1}\) verifies the trace expression independently. The full derivation and rational/numerical checks are preserved in the critical audit.''','A',
 r'''\citet[\S4, Theorem10, equations18 and22]{gelfandgindikin1977complex} gives the corrected kernel in1977. This is a precise publication match to the construction, with a literal notebook error.''',
